{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"2cc216388f21872236ca2d6d035d8e60c3edd4d1422ecfa8ddbb25b6da83800d","digest":{"component_or_area":"LLM provider framework and verdict signing","key_entities":["provider_factory hook","ProviderSession","ModelProfile","first_class tier","best_effort tier","KNOWN_PROVIDER_NAMES","capabilities_for()","provider_provenance","bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6","REBAR_LLM_MODEL","BedrockProvider","AnthropicProvider","pydantic-ai 1.107.1"],"problem_keywords":["ADR documentation","provider seam","two-tier LLM support","bedrock","anthropic","pydantic-ai","model classes","prompt caching","provider provenance","capability resolution"],"propositions":["The LLM provider seam is pydantic-ai's provider_factory hook, a per-run SESSION object that rebar registers builders into before model inference, not a bare function or rebar invention.","Capability decisions are driven by ModelProfile field presence (native_structured_output, prompt_cache_style) and exact-id matching for overrides, never by provider-name string matching or isinstance checks.","Two support tiers (first_class and best_effort) stamp provenance in sidecars; first_class applies to native Anthropic and Bedrock builders; best_effort applies to gateway/* providers and OpenAI-compatible endpoints with base_url configured.","Three reserved model class names (frontier, standard, trivial) occupy the existing model-string space without schema change; they are operator-filled config slots resolved per-call, not per-run, and route to different model instances across multi-pass gates.","Bedrock uses ambient AWS credential chain (instance role) with no rebar-managed key; region resolution requires both REBAR_LLM_BEDROCK_REGION env var AND AWS_DEFAULT_REGION, as IMDS alone does not supply region and boto3 reads only the latter."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787317816107160001,"uuid":"904bc63c-f608-4544-9242-3b1cdceaacf4"}